C2 -- the projector is spatial: the leaf-smoothing is instantaneous (PAPER9's foliation corollary)
====================================================================================================
  [PASS] C2 the projector is purely SPATIAL: h_mn u^n = 0 exactly, so Delta_h = h^mn D_m D_n has no time derivative and the leaf-smoothing (1 - l^2 Delta_h)^{-1} is INSTANTANEOUS on each slice -- exactly the non-dynamical foliation PAPER9's corollary predicts for any 2-DOF single-metric MOND theory
         measured: h_mn u^n = [0, 0, 0, 0]
         reading:  consistency: the action is a concrete instance of PAPER9's class, so it MUST carry the instantaneous constraint -- and it does, transparently, rather than hiding it

